                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "Candy Row now has\na route plan with\nnamed duties.\nNobody had to buy",
                                  "the sorting house\nto make its public\nservice work. The\nnext problem",
                                  "is a machine.\nRivet is pleased.\nMachines rarely\nask for boundless",
                                  "service, though\nsome request\nunreasonable oil."
                                ],
