                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "Brassworks kept\nthe dismantled\nAurora regulator\nin a guarded cage",
                                  "until the guard\nretired and took\nthe cage home as a\ngreenhouse.",
                                  "Rivet saved the\nparts on shelves.\nShe wants you to\nunderstand what",
                                  "they do before\nagreeing to make\nmore of anything."
                                ],
